WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.067
Theo walked into the kitchen.

2
00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:12.961
His mom was cooking.

3
00:00:12.962 --> 00:00:16.057
"What's for dinner?" he asked.

4
00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:21.522
"I'm making your favorite food," said Mom.

5
00:00:21.523 --> 00:00:26.579
"Macaroni and cheese."

6
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:30.434
"Yum!" said Theo.

7
00:00:30.435 --> 00:00:37.234
Then he saw some spinach and carrots.

8
00:00:37.235 --> 00:00:40.972
"Yuck!" said Theo.

9
00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:44.811
"What are those vegetables for?"

10
00:00:44.812 --> 00:00:49.007
"They're for a salad," said Mom.

11
00:00:49.008 --> 00:00:53.770
"It has salmon and vegetables."

12
00:00:53.771 --> 00:00:59.081
"Salmon!" cried Theo. "No, thanks.

13
00:00:59.082 --> 00:01:03.645
I'm just going to eat macaroni and cheese."

14
00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:08.767
"You can't eat just that," said Mom.

15
00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:14.535
"You need food from all five food groups."

16
00:01:14.536 --> 00:01:21.221
"Macaroni and cheese has stuff from two food groups," said Theo.

17
00:01:21.222 --> 00:01:26.418
"The macaroni is a grain, and the cheese is a dairy food.

18
00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:29.291
Isn't that enough?"

19
00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:34.757
"You need vegetables too.

20
00:01:34.758 --> 00:01:38.427
Carrots have vitamin A," said Mom.

21
00:01:38.428 --> 00:01:41.655
She started chopping some carrots.

22
00:01:41.656 --> 00:01:48.225
"Vitamin A is good for your eyes."

23
00:01:48.226 --> 00:01:53.870
"Is salmon good for us?" asked Theo.

24
00:01:53.871 --> 00:01:59.910
"Salmon is in the protein group," said Mom.

25
00:01:59.911 --> 00:02:07.694
"Protein helps build muscles."

26
00:02:07.695 --> 00:02:11.657
"Okay," said Theo.

27
00:02:11.658 --> 00:02:20.582
"So far dinner includes grains, vegetables, dairy, and protein.

28
00:02:20.583 --> 00:02:28.975
But you said there are five food groups."

29
00:02:28.976 --> 00:02:34.153
Just then Dad came in from the garden.

30
00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:39.494
He had a basket of strawberries.

31
00:02:39.495 --> 00:02:47.854
"The other group is fruits," Mom said.

32
00:02:47.855 --> 00:02:51.612
"We're having strawberries for dessert."

33
00:02:51.613 --> 00:02:55.665
"Yum!" said Theo.

34
00:02:55.666 --> 00:02:58.706
Mom grinned.

35
00:02:58.707 --> 00:03:04.173
"See? Healthy foods are delicious!"

36
00:03:04.174 --> 00:03:10.806
"I'm still not sure about that salad," Theo said.

37
00:03:10.807 --> 00:03:18.593
"But I will try it!"

